        "original_id": "cba29b64-62b4-54a4-b645-f2e36d1f953e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marwan Kenzari, Nicholas Hoult, Felicity Jones, Ben Kingsley, Anthony Hopkins\n- Films: Collide, Undiscovered\n- Awards: Golden Calf for Best Actor\n- Topics: box office records\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, Marwan Kenzari won a Golden Calf for Best Actor.\n- The film Collide stars Nicholas Hoult, Felicity Jones, Marwan Kenzari, Ben Kingsley, and Anthony Hopkins.\n- In March 2017, Collide broke Undiscovered's record for the largest percentage drop-off in ticket sales from opening weekend to second weekend in theatrical release with an 86.4% drop.",
